            <description><![CDATA[<h2>ScreenTake 0.1.23</h2><ul><li>Prepare bug reports in the app with recent logs and app information that you can review, edit, or exclude.</li><li>Capture the app window or attach an image; cover sensitive areas with solid black and save a flattened screenshot without source photo metadata.</li><li>Continue to a public GitHub issue and paste the reviewed screenshot before submitting. Requires a GitHub account; videos and project files are not included.</li></ul><p>Requires Apple Silicon and macOS 13 or later.</p>
]]></description>
