            <description><![CDATA[<h2>ScreenTake 0.1.22</h2><ul><li>Cover or blur sensitive details with timed privacy masks, motion keyframes, and tracking. Review coverage before sharing.</li><li>Edit privacy masks through MCP with shared Undo and portable project persistence.</li><li>Use Natural or Soft Peach camera effects; MCP supports softPeach, lip blur, and lip volume. Reconnect your AI client after updating.</li></ul><p>Requires Apple Silicon and macOS 13 or later.</p>
]]></description>
